  "details": "Gesture #7 ( thumbs up ) when used on both hands at the same time resets the animations for remote users but stays visible for the local user.\nvideo of glowsticks & facial expressions resetting when both gesture 7's are active : https://streamable.com/rvr22e\nscreenshot : https://deer.s-ul.eu/q9OqzvjT.png\n\nAfter some more testing, it's a problem with all avatars, not just avatar 3.0 models. Avatar 2.0 models have the same problems.",
